# Build output
/bin/
/dist/
*.exe

# Case output — never commit evidence or derived case data
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
/output/
/working/

# Working notes, deliberately not published
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
FINDINGS.md

# The planning and reference material under docs/ stays local. It is the record
# of how the tool got here rather than of what it does, and a historical plan
# published beside the code is read as documentation and believed.
#
# OPEN-WORK.md is the exception and is deliberately published: the README points
# at it, and a forensic tool that lists what it does not claim is more use than
# one that lists only what it does.
docs/*
!docs/OPEN-WORK.md
